  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* --- 2. what <e8| exp(x E21 + y E31 + z E32) can actually reach --- *)\ne8 = UnitVector[8, 8];\nnilp = x Ee[1][2, 1] + y Ee[1][3, 1] + z Ee[1][3, 2];\nrot = Expand[e8 . MatrixExp[nilp]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{k, wts[[k]], rot[[k]], {0, 0, cc, 0, bb, 0, aa, 1}[[k]]}, {k, 8}],\n  {\"slot\", \"weight\", \"<e8|exp(n)\", \"target\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n(* slot 6 = x forces x = 0;  slot 1 = -y^2/3 then forces y = 0.\n   Only slot 7 = 2z/3 survives: the pure-lowering orbit is the 1-parameter E32 rotation. *)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
