  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* --- 3. explicit intertwiner  v_k <-> 3x3 matrix M_k.\n   Sum_i E_ii = 3 on this space, so the site-1 rep is  adjoint (x) det, i.e. the action is\n   M -> [E_ij, M] + delta_ij M.  Solution is unique up to scale; fix M_1 = E13. --- *)\nClearAll[el, cvar, mm0, vars, eqsInt, amat, ns, mAd];\nel[p_, q_] := el[p, q] = Normal @ SparseArray[{{p, q} -> 1}, {3, 3}];\nmm0 = Table[cvar[k, p, q], {k, 8}, {p, 3}, {q, 3}];\nvars = Flatten[mm0];\neqsInt = Flatten[Table[\n    el[i, j] . mm0[[k]] - mm0[[k]] . el[i, j] + KroneckerDelta[i, j] mm0[[k]]\n     - Sum[Ee[1][i, j][[l, k]] mm0[[l]], {l, 8}],\n    {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {k, 8}]];\namat = Normal[Last[CoefficientArrays[eqsInt, vars]]];\nns = NullSpace[amat];\nmAd = mm0 /. Thread[vars -> First[ns]];\nmAd = mAd/mAd[[1, 1, 3]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{k, wts[[k]], MatrixForm[mAd[[k]]]}, {k, 8}],\n  {\"slot\", \"weight\", \"M_k\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
