      {
       "data": "Out[64]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{Y(aa,bb,cc)} & \\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{\\mathrm{bb}}{6} & \\frac{\\mathrm{aa}}{2} & \\frac{1}{3}\\\\0 & -\\frac{\\mathrm{bb}}{6} & 0\\\\0 & \\mathrm{cc} & \\frac{\\mathrm{bb}}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{check Tr[Y M\\_k]} & \\left\\{0,0,\\mathrm{cc},0,\\mathrm{bb},0,\\mathrm{aa},1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{Y\\_8  (the reference <e8|)} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{3}\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank Y\\_8 , Y\\_8\\^{}2} & \\left\\{1,\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "feb10797-ea21-4bf7-9cf1-3de4202e9095"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* --- 5. why no group element works ---\n   g in GL(3) acts by conjugation, so rank and spectrum are invariants.\n   <e8| sits at the rank-one NILPOTENT matrix E13/3 (minimal orbit).\n   Y is invertible as soon as bb != 0, so it lies in no GL(3) orbit of <e8|. *)\nGrid[{\n  {\"Det Y\", Factor[Det[yMat]]},\n  {\"char poly\", Factor[CharacteristicPolynomial[yMat, t]]},\n  {\"eigenvalues\", {bb/3, -bb/6, -bb/6}},\n  {\"2x2 minors of Y + (bb/6) 1\", Factor[Flatten[Minors[yMat + (bb/6) IdentityMatrix[3], 2]]]},\n  {\"=> Y semisimple iff\", cc == 3 aa bb/4}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
